==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Piloswine|27}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion.
*{{a|Thick Fat}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Piloswine}} can have.
*'''Hammer In''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Mysterious Treasures|Larvitar|87}} from the {{TCG|Mysterious Treasures}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

